# Clinical wound images: never tracked in git, uploaded to Google Drive
# separately for Colab access. Only datasets/README.md is versioned.
datasets/*
!datasets/README.md
*.zip

# Local ablation outputs (Colab-generated, not source-controlled)
task_1/checkpoints/
task_1/results/
task_1/configs/resolved_grid.json
task_2/checkpoints/
task_2/results/
task_2/configs/resolved_grid.json
task_3/checkpoints/
task_3/results/
task_3/configs/resolved_grid.json

# more_experiments (Chapter 8): checkpoints are large Colab-generated
# artifacts (regenerable, not source-controlled) wherever they live, at
# any depth under exp/. results/*.csv are the actual experiment numbers --
# small text files, kept and tracked, same for configs/, scripts/, manifests/.
more_experiments/**/*.pt
more_experiments/piid_crops/crops/
more_experiments/piid_crops/manifests/

# exp-10: stray local results.csv (not configs/base.yaml's own
# results/exp10_results.csv -- a leftover/duplicate local run artifact).
# Numbers already live in README.md and results/colab_2026-10-28/analysis.md.
more_experiments/exp/exp10_boundary_specific_representation/results/results.csv

# exp-9: cached teacher embeddings (regenerable via scripts/extract_features.py,
# same reasoning as the .pt rule above -- index.csv stays tracked, it's the
# small manifest, not a generated artifact)
more_experiments/exp/exp9_feature_distillation/features/*.npy

# exp-11: cached encoder features/predictions (regenerable via
# scripts/extract_features.py + train_probe.py against the frozen task_3
# checkpoint -- same reasoning as exp-9's rule above). The *_summary.json
# and *_per_image.csv files are the actual small, readable results and
# stay tracked.
more_experiments/exp/exp11_linear_probe/results/fold_*/*.npy

# exp-11: fold_1/fold_2 three-fold rollup + per-fold result files -- kept
# locally but not tracked (only fold_0's original committed numbers stay
# in git history; the 3-fold aggregation is exploratory and not meant to
# be a tracked source of truth yet).
more_experiments/exp/exp11_linear_probe/results/aggregate_summary.csv
more_experiments/exp/exp11_linear_probe/results/aggregate_summary.json
more_experiments/exp/exp11_linear_probe/results/fold_1/
more_experiments/exp/exp11_linear_probe/results/fold_2/

# exp-9 distillation run was killed after fold0 (doesn't beat baseline, not
# pursued further -- see commit 5d4a7f6) -- its one-fold CSV would misread
# as a completed 3-fold result if left tracked, so unlike other exp*/results/
# it's excluded wholesale rather than just the binary artifacts.
more_experiments/exp/exp9_feature_distillation/results/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

